  "instance_name": "meme_format_of_innocent_child",
  "label": "Meme Format of Innocent Child",
  "description": "The meme format uses a child's image to convey a message, often to appear more sincere, naive, or morally authoritative. This is a common meme trope that leverages the perceived innocence of children to make a statement seem more genuine or universally accepted. The child's gesture is a visual shorthand for 'I believe this' or 'This is obvious to me.'",
